    "statement": "Shear bond strength (MPa) of a veneer ceramic bonded to direct resin nano-hybrid composite was measured in 5 groups of 16 specimens: a control (TC) and four groups aged by thermocycling for 1, 3, 6 and 12 months. The paper prints only each group's mean and SD, so the 16 values of each group were rebuilt to have exactly that mean and SD. Does the mean bond strength differ between the groups? Test at α = 0.05. Source: Medical Science Monitor 30:e945243, Table 2.",
